From: nuubOS Project <noreply@nuubos.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] nuubOS: no server-side decorations

A console has no window frames. Ports (PortMaster) open plain SDL
windows that ask for server-side decorations before they have the title
or app_id a window rule could match ("serverDecoration" and
SetDecorations had no effect): they came up with a desktop title bar.
view_wants_decorations() is false for every view.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [nuubOS specific]

--- a/src/view.c
+++ b/src/view.c
@@ -1486,6 +1486,14 @@
 bool
 view_wants_decorations(struct view *view)
 {
+	/*
+	 * nuubOS: a console has no window frames. Ports (PortMaster) open
+	 * plain SDL windows and asked for server-side decorations before any
+	 * title or app_id a window rule could match: they came up with a
+	 * desktop title bar.
+	 */
+	return false;
+
 	/* Window-rules take priority if they exist for this view */
 	switch (window_rules_get_property(view, "serverDecoration")) {
 	case LAB_PROP_TRUE:
